{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4d69d1861fee444d9c5789e3cc4c771c6c55a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2 \\times 10^{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> is doubled, what is the result?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d38857a595f1b5b4d22467f1f26960dc6c9f8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 2.4 \\times 10^{6} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 2.4 \\times 10^{12} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 2.4 \\times 10^{3} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 1.2 \\times 10^{12} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 0.6 \\times 10^{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"718\" height=\"21\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Doubling a number means multiplying that number by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or adding it to itself.\n</p><p>This means that doubling <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4d69d1861fee444d9c5789e3cc4c771c6c55a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2 \\times 10^{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d722858dbba0dcc1e62102e14e410288ed3301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2 \\times 10^{6} \\times 2 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 2.4 \\times 10^{6}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"246\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title